{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to RENAME/REDEFINE GO:0106340 tRNA (cytidine(32)/guanosine(34)-2'-O)-methyltransferase activity\n-> tRNA (guanosine(34)-2'-O)-methyltransferase activity.\nsee [https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30313].\nGO:0106340 definition is being narrowed. Annotated genes may consider co-annotate with GO:0106339: tRNA (cytidine(32)-2'-O)-methyltransferase activity. \n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Le7aSacw0WYDtdpccJSPJYd0fVwOcUOApZFTg_-ACU0/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nFlybase 2\n~PomBase 1~ DONE\nReactome 2\nUniProt 2\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-06-05T22:25:01Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0106340 tRNA (cytidine(32)/guanosine(34)-2'-O)-methyltransferase activity", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-11-06T10:46:00Z"}
